---
description: Safety and confirmation rules for Kling AI generation
alwaysApply: false
---

- Require explicit user confirmation immediately before every billable generation submission.
- Never retry a generation submission automatically after a timeout or ambiguous response; query the task first.
- Keep task IDs and media URLs private unless the user asks to share them.
- Do not describe a generation as successful until the Kling MCP response indicates a terminal success state.
